    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save the next hit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music is the most valuable asset in the world, and hard drives filled with unreleased tracks have been stolen by a gang that wants to monopolize the charts. It's up to you to recover them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/18d8403a10584abb284ae728e666c749.poster.avif?t=1751554859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/18d8403a10584abb284ae728e666c749.webm?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/18d8403a10584abb284ae728e666c749.mp4?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Tina &amp; Tunner \u2014 she's the best getaway driver in the hood, he's a sharpshooter with perfect aim. Together, this couple uses their unique talents in high-octane missions, combining action and rhythm in a race against time to save the art that moves the world: music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/00ddbdcd26d3ead86884d9869d4138e9.poster.avif?t=1751554859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/00ddbdcd26d3ead86884d9869d4138e9.webm?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/00ddbdcd26d3ead86884d9869d4138e9.mp4?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/3b782b2f6cc0a4aea42f8b450f161888.poster.avif?t=1751554859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/3b782b2f6cc0a4aea42f8b450f161888.webm?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/3b782b2f6cc0a4aea42f8b450f161888.mp4?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Fast-paced gameplay focused on driving and shootouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Vibrant visuals with a strong urban identity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Original soundtrack by rapper NP Vocal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Charismatic characters and a story inspired by street culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Missions full of action, chases, and musical challenges</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save the next hit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music is the most valuable asset in the world, and hard drives filled with unreleased tracks have been stolen by a gang that wants to monopolize the charts. It's up to you to recover them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/18d8403a10584abb284ae728e666c749.poster.avif?t=1751554859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/18d8403a10584abb284ae728e666c749.webm?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/18d8403a10584abb284ae728e666c749.mp4?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Tina &amp; Tunner \u2014 she's the best getaway driver in the hood, he's a sharpshooter with perfect aim. Together, this couple uses their unique talents in high-octane missions, combining action and rhythm in a race against time to save the art that moves the world: music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/00ddbdcd26d3ead86884d9869d4138e9.poster.avif?t=1751554859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/00ddbdcd26d3ead86884d9869d4138e9.webm?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/00ddbdcd26d3ead86884d9869d4138e9.mp4?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/3b782b2f6cc0a4aea42f8b450f161888.poster.avif?t=1751554859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/3b782b2f6cc0a4aea42f8b450f161888.webm?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/extras/3b782b2f6cc0a4aea42f8b450f161888.mp4?t=1751554859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Fast-paced gameplay focused on driving and shootouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Vibrant visuals with a strong urban identity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Original soundtrack by rapper NP Vocal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Charismatic characters and a story inspired by street culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Missions full of action, chases, and musical challenges</p></li></ul>",
